{"format": "chem-bench/2", "note": "The copper cycle (GAME_SPEC §7, §9, §13.7, Stage 92; docs/CURRICULUM.md, experiment 11), from copper nitrate: 0.500 g of copper as copper nitrate in 25 g of water. Sodium hydroxide in excess: blue copper hydroxide. Heated in the excess base: black copper oxide (through Cu(OH)4 2-, the base route). Sulfuric acid in modest excess: blue copper sulfate. Magnesium powder in excess: copper put out as a red-brown powder (the acid takes some of the magnesium as hydrogen). Hydrochloric acid: the leftover magnesium dissolved, the copper not. Filtered, scraped into a dish and weighed: the percent recovery. Read by instruments.", "readings": "instruments", "seed": 11, "grid": [32, 15], "room": {"celsius": 20, "air_mol": 1000}, "items": [{"id": "scale", "kind": "balance", "model": "analytical", "at": [1, 13]}, {"id": "burner", "kind": "burner", "celsius": 1927, "conductance": 0.25, "at": [1, 8]}, {"id": "beaker", "kind": "vessel", "glassware": "beaker", "volume_ml": 250, "wall": "glass", "wall_g": 80, "at": [6, 7], "label": "copper nitrate solution: 0.500 g of copper", "contents": {"water": {"g": 25}, "copper_nitrate_aq": {"mol": 0.0078683}}}, {"id": "base", "kind": "vessel", "glassware": "bottle", "volume_ml": 500, "wall": "glass", "wall_g": 300, "at": [10, 7], "label": "sodium hydroxide, 2 M", "contents": {"water": {"g": 98}, "sodium_hydroxide_aq": {"mol": 0.2}}}, {"id": "acid", "kind": "vessel", "glassware": "bottle", "volume_ml": 500, "wall": "glass", "wall_g": 300, "at": [14, 7], "label": "sulfuric acid, 1.5 M", "contents": {"water": {"g": 95}, "sulfuric_acid_aq": {"mol": 0.15}}}, {"id": "hcl", "kind": "vessel", "glassware": "bottle", "volume_ml": 500, "wall": "glass", "wall_g": 300, "at": [18, 7], "label": "hydrochloric acid, 2 M", "contents": {"water": {"g": 96}, "hydrochloric_acid_aq": {"mol": 0.2}}}, {"id": "mg", "kind": "vessel", "glassware": "beaker", "volume_ml": 50, "wall": "glass", "wall_g": 40, "at": [22, 8], "label": "magnesium powder, 0.5 g", "contents": {"magnesium": {"g": 0.5, "particles": 550000}}}, {"id": "funnel", "kind": "vessel", "glassware": "filter_funnel", "volume_ml": 100, "wall": "glass", "wall_g": 40, "at": [25, 0], "label": "filter funnel, grade 1 paper"}, {"id": "flask", "kind": "vessel", "glassware": "conical_flask", "volume_ml": 250, "wall": "glass", "wall_g": 100, "at": [25, 8], "label": "filtrate"}, {"id": "dish", "kind": "vessel", "glassware": "beaker", "volume_ml": 50, "wall": "glass", "wall_g": 30, "at": [29, 8], "label": "weighing dish"}]}